@lang en
IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate

-- Manulife Vietnam term life product terms ("Bảo hiểm nhân thọ có thời hạn"), row VN-11.
-- THE NOUNS: DECLARE and nothing else. Every rule module imports this one.
--
-- Source: ../../source/raw/manulife-term-life.txt, the pdftotext rendering (reading order, no
-- -layout) of manulife-term-life.pdf (sha256 145e8c27...ee626c), retrieved 2026-10-06 from the
-- insurer's website. A `-- src:N |` comment quotes line N of that rendering; every one of them was
-- generated by tools/vnsrc.py, none typed.
--
-- Money is Vietnamese dong (VND), a bare NUMBER: Art 6 makes every payment in "đồng Việt Nam".
-- Days are calendar dates (IMPORT daydate). The document counts its periods in days ("ngày"),
-- months ("tháng") and years ("năm") and never says "working day"; NOTES.md fork F2 says how each
-- is counted.
--
-- Membership test for this module: a witness of ordinary competence could testify to the fact,
-- or the contract page, the application or the claim file records it. Whether the fact makes a
-- benefit payable is a rule, and belongs in the module for the Article that says so.
-- Identifiers cite the document's Articles ("Điều") as "Art N"; Art 3 has items "a.", "b." and
-- "C." (sic), cited here as Art 3(a), 3(b) and 3(c).

§ `Nouns for the Manulife term life product terms`

§§ `The parties`

-- Art 1.1 "Công ty" is Manulife Vietnam; Art 1.2 "Bên mua bảo hiểm" is the person or organisation
-- named as policyholder on the contract page; Art 8 "Người thụ hưởng" is the beneficiary; Art 15
-- "người được chuyển nhượng" is the assignee. These are the parties to the regulative rules.
-- src:8 | 1.1. Công ty: Công ty có nghĩa là Công ty Trách
-- src:9 | nhiệm Hữu hạn Manulife (Việt Nam). Công
-- src:14 | Hợp đồng bảo hiểm là người hoặc tổ chức
-- src:15 | được ghi tên Bên mua bảo hiểm trong Trang
DECLARE `A party` IS ONE OF
    `the Company`
    `the policyholder`
    `a beneficiary`
    `an assignee`

-- The acts the regulative rules name (Arts 4, 5 and 16).
DECLARE `An act` IS ONE OF
    `pay the premium due, to the Company or its agent`
    `send the Company a written request to cancel`
    `return the premium receipts to the Company`
    `refund the premium paid, less the medical expenses of assessing the risk`
    `pay the death benefit`
    `pay the death benefit with interest at the State Bank of Vietnam's overdue-debt rate`

§§ `The contract page`

-- The contract page ("Trang Hợp đồng") carries what this document leaves to it. Each field is an
-- input with no default. Art 1.5 counts months, contract years, anniversaries and the maturity
-- date from the effective date ("Ngày hiệu lực Hợp đồng") written on the contract page:
-- src:37 | của Hợp đồng bảo hiểm sẽ được tính từ Ngày
-- src:38 | hiệu lực Hợp đồng (là ngày Hợp đồng bảo
-- src:39 | hiểm bắt đầu có hiệu lực, tính theo ngày ký
-- src:46 | Ngày đáo hạn, như được nêu tại Trang Hợp
-- src:47 | đồng, có nghĩa là ngày kết thúc Hợp đồng
-- `sum insured` ("Số tiền bảo hiểm") is the amount on the contract page or as later approved
-- (Art 3(a)(i)), before any correction under Art 9.
-- `issue date` is the day the contract was issued ("ngày cấp Hợp đồng bảo hiểm"). Arts 1.3, 7, 10
-- and 11 count from it. The document never defines it, and it is not the effective date (fork F3).
DECLARE `The contract page` HAS
    `sum insured`    IS A NUMBER
    `effective date` IS A DATE
    `maturity date`  IS A DATE
    `issue date`     IS A DATE

§§ `The application`

-- The application ("Đơn yêu cầu bảo hiểm"). Art 1.5 requires a valid one to be signed by the
-- policyholder and by the insured; Art 9 corrects a misstated Age or sex in it, and its last
-- paragraph turns on a misstated Age alone; Art 17 sends a dispute to the court nearest the
-- policyholder's address stated in it.
DECLARE `The application` HAS
    `signed by the policyholder`               IS A BOOLEAN
    `signed by the insured`                    IS A BOOLEAN
    `Age misstated in it`                      IS A BOOLEAN
    `sex misstated in it`                      IS A BOOLEAN
    `address of the policyholder stated in it` IS A STRING

§§ `The insured`

-- Art 1.3: the insured ("Người được bảo hiểm") is the person whose life is the subject of the
-- contract; the insured may be, but need not be, the policyholder.
-- src:21 | 1.3. Người được bảo hiểm: Người được bảo
-- src:22 | hiểm là người mà tính mạng của người đó là
-- `true date of birth` gives the insured's true Age (Art 1.4; Art 9 "Tuổi ... thực").
DECLARE `The insured` HAS
    `true date of birth`                   IS A DATE
    `resided in Vietnam on the issue date` IS A BOOLEAN
    `also the policyholder`                IS A BOOLEAN

§§ `Premiums`

-- Art 5: a premium counts as paid only when paid to the Company or to its agent.
DECLARE `A payee of the premium` IS ONE OF
    `paid to the Company`
    `paid to an agent of the Company`
    `paid to someone else`

-- One instalment of the premium plan ("Kế hoạch đóng phí bảo hiểm") on the contract page.
-- `paid in full on` is NOTHING where it has not been paid in full.
DECLARE `A premium instalment` HAS
    `due date`        IS A DATE
    `paid in full on` IS A MAYBE DATE
    `paid to`         IS A `A payee of the premium`

-- The premium position at the death. INPUT CONVENTIONS:
-- * `instalment in default` is the earliest instalment falling due after the effective date, or
--   after the most recent reinstatement, that was not paid in full on or before its due date;
--   NOTHING where every instalment due before the death was paid on time.
-- * `premiums due and unpaid at the death` is the amount of premium that had fallen due and was
--   still unpaid on the date of death (a death in the grace period leaves one instalment unpaid).
-- * `premiums of the policy year not yet due at the death` is the rest of that contract year's
--   premium, under a half-yearly, quarterly or monthly mode, that had not yet fallen due (Art 5).
-- * `total premium paid` is every premium paid since the effective date; `total premium payable
--   at the true Age and sex` is what that premium would have been at the insured's true Age and
--   sex (Art 9); the two are equal where nothing was misstated.
-- * `reasonable costs and expenses deducted by the Company` is the Company's figure for
--   "các chi phí và phí tổn phát sinh hợp lý" (Arts 3(c), 9, 11). The document gives no criteria.
DECLARE `The premium record` HAS
    `first premium paid`                                    IS A BOOLEAN
    `instalment in default`                                 IS A MAYBE `A premium instalment`
    `premiums due and unpaid at the death`                  IS A NUMBER
    `premiums of the policy year not yet due at the death`  IS A NUMBER
    `total premium paid`                                    IS A NUMBER
    `total premium payable at the true Age and sex`         IS A NUMBER
    `reasonable costs and expenses deducted by the Company` IS A NUMBER
    `date of the most recent reinstatement`                 IS A MAYBE DATE

§§ `Disclosure`

-- Art 10, about information other than Age or sex (Art 9 deals with those; fork F11).
-- * `material information not disclosed or misstated`: the information was material to the
--   insurance ("có tầm quan trọng đối với việc bảo hiểm"), a judgement recorded as found.
-- * `the omission not itself declared by the person concerned`: the insured or policyholder
--   concerned did not declare the non-disclosure or misstatement either (src:264-267).
-- * `the Company has treated the contract as void under Art 10`: the Company's own decision.
DECLARE `The disclosure record` HAS
    `material information not disclosed or misstated`             IS A BOOLEAN
    `the omission not itself declared by the person concerned`    IS A BOOLEAN
    `fraud`                                                       IS A BOOLEAN
    `the Company has treated the contract as void under Art 10`   IS A BOOLEAN

§§ `The death`

-- The cause fields carry Art 3(c)'s causal words: "trực tiếp hay gián tiếp" (directly or
-- indirectly). Art 3(c)(i) names no person who commits the crime; the two crime fields keep the
-- insured's crime apart from another person's (fork F6, finding 1).
DECLARE `The death` HAS
    `date of death` IS A DATE
    `by suicide`    IS A BOOLEAN
    `resulting directly or indirectly from the insured committing a crime, or intentionally committing a criminal offence` IS A BOOLEAN
    `resulting directly or indirectly from a crime committed by someone other than the insured`                           IS A BOOLEAN
    `related to AIDS, an AIDS-related condition (ARC), or HIV infection`                                                 IS A BOOLEAN

§§ `The claim`

-- Art 16. The five documents are items (i) to (v); `proof of age submitted earlier` is the
-- parenthesis in (v). `date the policyholder learned of the insured event` is JUST a date only
-- where the policyholder proves not having known when the insured event occurred (src:371-375).
-- `rider benefits payable` is what the riders ("điều khoản bảo hiểm bổ trợ") pay under their own
-- terms, which are not in this document (Art 3(a)(ii)).
DECLARE `The claim` HAS
    `date the claim was made`                            IS A DATE
    `proof of death received`                            IS A BOOLEAN
    `the contract provided`                              IS A BOOLEAN
    `the Company's forms completed`                      IS A BOOLEAN
    `evidence of the claimants' relationship provided`   IS A BOOLEAN
    `evidence of the insured event provided`             IS A BOOLEAN
    `evidence of the insured's Age provided`             IS A BOOLEAN
    `proof of age submitted earlier`                     IS A BOOLEAN
    `days of force majeure or other objective obstacle`  IS A NUMBER
    `date the policyholder learned of the insured event` IS A MAYBE DATE
    `rider benefits payable`                             IS A NUMBER

§§ `The policyholder's requests`

-- Art 4 (a written request to cancel, counted from receipt of the contract) and Art 18(iv) (a
-- request to terminate). NOTHING where no such request was made.
DECLARE `The policyholder's requests` HAS
    `date the contract was received`              IS A DATE
    `date a written request to cancel was sent`   IS A MAYBE DATE
    `date the policyholder requested termination` IS A MAYBE DATE

§§ `A death claim`

DECLARE `A death claim` HAS
    `contract page` IS A `The contract page`
    `application`   IS A `The application`
    `insured`       IS A `The insured`
    `premiums`      IS A `The premium record`
    `disclosure`    IS A `The disclosure record`
    `requests`      IS A `The policyholder's requests`
    `death`         IS A `The death`
    `claim`         IS A `The claim`

-- What a death claim comes to. Each outcome the document names is a member; where the document is
-- silent the encoding refuses, and a refusal is not a member (NOTES.md section 1).
DECLARE `The outcome of a death claim` IS ONE OF
    `the death benefit is payable`                    HAS `amount` IS A NUMBER
    `no death benefit, and the premium is refunded`   HAS `under`  IS A STRING
                                                          `refund` IS A NUMBER
    `no death benefit: the contract was not in force` HAS `reason` IS A STRING
    `the Company has treated the contract as void`
    `the claim for the death benefit is out of time`

§§ `Article 4: a request to cancel`

DECLARE `A request to cancel under Art 4` HAS
    `date the contract was received`                          IS A DATE
    `date the written request was sent`                       IS A DATE
    `premium paid`                                            IS A NUMBER
    `medical expenses the Company paid in assessing the risk` IS A NUMBER
    `premium receipts returned to the Company`                IS A BOOLEAN

DECLARE `The result of a request to cancel under Art 4` IS ONE OF
    `cancelled, and the premium is refunded`          HAS `refund` IS A NUMBER
    `cancelled, and nothing is refunded`
    `not cancelled under Art 4: the request was late`

§§ `Article 8: beneficiaries`

-- `share stated` is the share the contract or the designation gives ("trừ khi có quy định khác"),
-- as a fraction; NOTHING where none is stated.
DECLARE `A beneficiary designation` HAS
    `name`         IS A STRING
    `share stated` IS A MAYBE NUMBER

DECLARE `A change of beneficiary` HAS
    `made while the insured was alive` IS A BOOLEAN
    `in writing`                       IS A BOOLEAN
    `approved by the Company`          IS A BOOLEAN

§§ `Article 2: an amendment`

DECLARE `A signatory for the Company` IS ONE OF
    `the General Director`
    `a Deputy General Director`
    `another officer`

DECLARE `An amendment` HAS
    `in writing`                       IS A BOOLEAN
    `signed for the Company by`        IS A `A signatory for the Company`
    `consented to by the policyholder` IS A BOOLEAN

§§ `Article 14: reinstatement`

DECLARE `An application to reinstate` HAS
    `date the contract terminated`                                IS A DATE
    `terminated for non-payment in the grace period`              IS A BOOLEAN
    `date of the application`                                     IS A DATE
    `evidence of insurability accepted by the Company`            IS A BOOLEAN
    `all overdue premiums paid with the interest the Company set` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the Company agreed to reinstate`                             IS A BOOLEAN

§§ `Article 15: an assignment`

DECLARE `An assignment` HAS
    `the insured alive when it was made`           IS A BOOLEAN
    `the contract in force when it was made`       IS A BOOLEAN
    `lawful and of all the policyholder's rights`  IS A BOOLEAN
    `written notice received by the Company`       IS A BOOLEAN
    `original instrument submitted to the Company` IS A BOOLEAN
    `approved by the Company in writing`           IS A BOOLEAN

§§ `Article 17: a dispute`

DECLARE `A dispute` HAS
    `date the dispute arose`       IS A DATE
    `settled by negotiation`       IS A BOOLEAN
    `court chosen by both parties` IS A MAYBE STRING

§§ `Article 18: termination`

DECLARE `A ground of termination under Art 18` IS ONE OF
    `(i) the premium due was not paid after the grace period`
    `(ii) the insured died`
    `(iii) the contract matured`
    `(iv) the policyholder requested termination`

DECLARE `A termination under Art 18` HAS
    `date`   IS A DATE
    `ground` IS A `A ground of termination under Art 18`
